 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Prepositions with the dative",
     "texto": [
      "Some prepositions always take the **dative**: **mit** (with), **von** (of/from), **aus** (from, out of), **nach** (after) and **zu** (to).",
      "With the article: **der** and **das** become **dem**; **die** becomes **der**; and plural **die** becomes **den**. Examples: **mit dem Tee** (with the tea), **mit der Tablette** (with the pill), **mit den Tabletten** (with the pills)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Article in the dative",
     "columnas": [
      {
       "texto": "Gender",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      },
      {
       "texto": "Article",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      },
      {
       "texto": "Example",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      }
     ],
     "filas": [
