     ],
     "nota": "",
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "When to take the medicine",
     "texto": [
      "**Dreimal täglich** = three times a day. **Vor dem Essen** = before eating; **nach dem Essen** = after eating.",
      "At the pharmacy you say **Nehmen Sie** (take it) to give the instruction. Careful: **Nehmen Sie** is an imperative, not the verb «to take» in general."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
